A component-based architecture using React will allow for reusable UI elements and efficient development. The data-first approach ensures that the design is driven by the information that needs to be displayed, rather than arbitrary aesthetics. A mobile-first approach guarantees accessibility across all devices.

Prioritize clear navigation and intuitive interactions. Use subtle animations with `framer-motion` to guide the user and provide feedback. Employ a 'Bento Grid' layout for the dashboard to present key information in an organized and easily digestible manner. Ensure all forms are easily accessible and validated.

