The UX strategy focuses on intuitive navigation, engaging visuals, and smooth interactions. Framer Motion is used for page transitions and subtle animations, enhancing the overall user experience. Mobile-first design ensures accessibility and responsiveness across devices. The design incorporates modern patterns such as Bento Grids to arrange product listings in an appealing and organized manner.

